# The wind on the modern spruce A (reports/content/2026-11-trees/fir/README.md): the set and the places of
# fir-probe.bench (scripts/content/fir_set.py probe; run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<that set>), at noon. Clips, not
# stills: a motion is judged by the eye on a clip. Each clip starts 3 s before the peak of a gust and runs 20 s,
# through the gust and the calm after it. The world's wind blows along +Z, away from the cameras and to their left.
#   wind-far    30 m from spruce A (18 m), the eye 1.7 m over the ground;
#   wind-near   5 m from its lower boughs;
#   wind-bough  3 m from a bough in the sun, from the side.
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh fir-wind
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 12 0

goto pos 39400 3790 -2000
clear 3000
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 39550 3946 -1820 41250 4210 650
wait 5000
foliage wait-gust 3000 0
rec wind-far
wait 20000
stop
wait 500

goto pos 40550 3420 -350
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 40710 3580 -130 41250 3725 650
wait 4000
foliage wait-gust 3000 0
rec wind-near
wait 20000
stop
wait 500

cam at 40840 3495 380 40870 3524 680
wait 2000
foliage wait-gust 3000 0
rec wind-bough
wait 20000
stop
wait 500
